msgid ""
"The camera needs to be mounted securely to the gimbal, but in such a way "
"that reduces/dampens vibrations from the motor."
msgstr "相机需牢固安装在云台上，同时应采用减震/隔振方式以降低电机震动传递。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:27
