#: cc7d0fdf04634414b694bb790d8f8b51 d8b7fe4484f64734bf622788267407cf
#: f7cf474540384254a9955fd104422dd4
msgid ""
"Common methods for mounting the camera on the gimbal include using soft "
"foam, stiff foam, neoprene tubes (mount camera on tube side), surgical tube,"
" rubber bands, nylon bolts (direct stiff attachment) and velcro."
msgstr "将相机安装到云台的常见方式包括：软泡沫、硬泡沫、氯丁橡胶管（将相机安装于管侧）、手术管、橡皮筋、尼龙螺栓（直接硬连接）以及魔术贴。"

