msgid ""
"Connect the gimbal's roll, pitch, and/or yaw servos signal and ground pins "
"to the autopilot's PWM output pins as shown below.  Most autopilots do not "
"provide power on the servo rail meaning a separate BEC is required."
msgstr ""
"将云台横滚、俯仰和/或偏航舵机的信号线和地线连接到飞控的 PWM 输出引脚（如下图所示）。大多数飞控不在舵机轨道上提供电源，因此需要独立的 BEC。"

