msgstr "Mission Planner 包含「Camera Gimbal」配置界面，但尚未更新以支持 ArduPilot 4.3（及更高版本）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:46
#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-gimbal.rst:47
#: 0a741c221fdd46a987689bf44d8b7eb5 3cf8754950e94884b5b283a8e809293b
#: 4e24d084d6f547c5a9dbf41942a19f05 67136a8d06b3447a8f7d5e0e5396ffa6
#: c1bd33c122444c7d86301b12f65305fd
msgid ""
"Connect to the autopilot with a ground station and set the following "
"parameters. These settings assume the autopilot's PWM outputs 9, 10 and 11 "
"will control the gimbal's roll, pitch and yaw angles respectively. They also"
" assume common angular ranges of the gimbal which may need adjusting to "
"match the actual gimbal being used."
msgstr ""
"使用地面站连接飞控并设置以下参数。这些设置假定飞控的 PWM 输出 9、10 和 11 "
"分别控制云台的横滚、俯仰和偏航角。同时假定云台具有常见的角度范围，实际使用时可能需要根据云台调整。"

